---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/paths';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Opportunities" description="Openings at the Climate Resilient and Equitable Infrastructure Lab.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: var(--measure-narrow);">
      <p class="kicker">Opportunities</p>
      <h1>Join the lab</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The lab works with graduate researchers, collaborators, and community partners on climate
        resilience and environmental justice.
      </p>
      <h2>Prospective students</h2>
      <p>
        Please review the <a href={sitePath('/projects')}>project areas</a> and recent
        <a href={sitePath('/publications')}>publications</a> first. A useful inquiry names the degree or
        appointment you are seeking, your relevant preparation, and one or two questions that
        connect your interests to the lab’s work. Formal openings and application deadlines are
        subject to Tufts department and program announcements.
      </p>
      <h2>Research collaboration</h2>
      <p>
        The lab welcomes focused proposals involving climate hazards, earthen infrastructure,
        remote sensing, risk analysis, and equitable adaptation. Please include the proposed
        contribution, likely partners, timing, and funding context.
      </p>
      <p>
        Start a conversation: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
